<title>GERMANY: Gerresheimer 1996 net profit slips.</title>
<headline>Gerresheimer 1996 net profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group profits from ordinary business 104.6   vs 88.8</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   65.8    vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,611   down four pct</p>
<p>    Dividend				     1.0     vs same</p>
<p>NOTE - German glass-maker Gerresheimer Glas said group net profit was &quot;slightly down on last year&quot; without detailing the exact figure for 1995. It said first quarter 1997 trading had been hit by price pressure and a market slump, with gross pre-tax profits falling to six million marks against some 20 million marks last time. Turnover for the period stood at 365 milion marks versus 387 million.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
